        "Travel danger, imprisonment, illness, affliction, and chosen support nonuse cannot be made loyalty tests. Modern workers retain rights to fair support, rest, accessibility, medical care, insurance, safe housing and transport, evacuation, confidentiality, and unpenalized refusal or exit."
